# Third-party licences (Rust dependencies)

Generated by `cargo about` from `Cargo.lock` for the Windows build (x86_64-pc-windows-msvc) of `tessalith.exe` and `sdc.exe`; dev-dependencies and build-only crates are excluded. Where a crate offers a choice of licences, the one listed here is the one Tessalith uses (see `about.toml`). Non-crate components are in `THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md`.

Note: the list is generated over the whole workspace, so it also includes `anyhow`, which only the non-shipped `sdc-bench` tool uses.

